p8YQyz_WkNkefNC7PmisBJWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSzNMqskEGfuugt6LFhPoId8on7ij8tXbNfkytTb7Yew&oe=6AF749E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1581620636270385", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1581620639603718_6147478633536165182_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rZzEm4HeqKoQ7kNvwGVS1eI&_nc_oc=AdqIUX7ZLkHZbMNFgTG7Lvdnb_AcPbTJZwpjdd1lYh_DhwLQPJV5XG0nYJSWSn6G8QY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7terHswYOoYb3COHgsn9HWsVBXTEY8XKYASrvQjD53A&oe=6AF72AEC"}, "display_name": "Marble Swoop", "keywords": ["marble", "puzzle", "action", "arcade"], "long_description": "Welcome to Marble Swoop, a thrilling and immersive VR action-puzzle experience specifically tailored for Meta Quest! \n\nStep into ancient mythical temples and take control of the rolling marble tracks. Your mission is simple but intense: match colored spheres, trigger massive chain reactions, and stop the moving marble train before it reaches the temple gates. \n\nKey Features:\n- Unique, Hand-Crafted Levels: Strategically balanced layout with a perfectly scaling difficulty curve and constantly updating new challenges.\n- Diverse Power-Ups & Custom Weapons: Unleash massive destruction with Slow-Mo, Stop, Rewind, Paint, Guided Aim, devastating Marbles Bombs, and the rapid-firing Minigun!\n- True VR Immersion: Fully optimized for Quest devices. Play standing or seated with highly accurate eye-level perspective and smooth physics.\n- Global Localization: Seamlessly available in multiple languages including English, Turkish, French, Spanish, Italian, and German.\n- Safe Progression & Credits: Features full cloud/local save data protection and dedicated credits section.\n\nCan you clear the ancient paths and become the ultimate marble master? Download Marble Swoop now and test your reflexes!", "short_description": "Experi